### Check All Categories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories
Accept: application/json

### Check Active Categories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Check Existing Admin Products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products
Accept: application/json

### Create Inactive Category - For Product API Testing
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Inactive Test Category",
  "description": "Category for testing inactive category validation",
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}

### 1. Get All Admin Products - Default Pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Admin Products - Custom Pagination and Sorting
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products?page=0&size=5&sort=name&direction=ASC
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Admin Products - Keyword Search
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products?keyword=keyboard
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get Admin Products - Filter by Category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products?categoryId=1
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Admin Products - Filter by Status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products?status=ACTIVE
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get Admin Products - Combined Filters
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products?keyword=keyboard&categoryId=1&status=ACTIVE&page=0&size=10&sort=createdAt&direction=DESC
Accept: application/json

### 7. Get Admin Products - Invalid Status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products?status=UNKNOWN
Accept: application/json

### 8. Get Admin Products - Invalid Page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products?page=-1
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Admin Products - Invalid Page Size
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products?size=51
Accept: application/json

### 10. Get Admin Products - Invalid Sort Field
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products?sort=invalidField
Accept: application/json

### 11. Get Admin Products - Invalid Direction
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products?direction=INVALID
Accept: application/json

### 12. Get Product by ID - Success
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 13. Get Product by ID - Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products/999999
Accept: application/json

### 14. Create Product - Success
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "sku": "TEST-PRODUCT-001",
  "name": "Test Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "Mechanical keyboard for API testing",
  "price": 750000.00,
  "stockQuantity": 25,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/keyboard.jpg",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

